Package: qt6-svg
Version: @DEB_QTSVG_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.qt.io/
Depends: qt6-base
Description: Qt 6 SVG libraries for the Xios desktop
 QtSvg and QtSvgWidgets plus the SVG image format plugin and icon engine.
 KDE theming leans on SVG throughout (Breeze icons, Plasma themes), so most
 Qt desktop software wants this installed.
 .
 Part of the Qt 6 stack for the KDE Plasma Mobile flavor of the Xios desktop.
